# Build context filter for the root Dockerfile.
#
# Staff data must never reach the image by accident: real employee CSVs, `.env` files and
# local scripts are excluded. The image only needs the four source trees plus the infra
# files the Dockerfile copies. Everything else is ignored by default.

*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!backend/**
!frontend/**
!packages/**
!infra/**
!docs/**

backend/**/.env
backend/**/node_modules
frontend/**/.env*
frontend/**/node_modules
frontend/**/.next
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.DS_Store
